елированным покрытием.</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Цвет: Золотой, черный</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Ширина: 2 см.</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Минимальная длина: 30,5 см.</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Максимальная длина: 39 см.</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Коллекция: Fetish Factory</span><br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Материал: Натуральная кожа, металл с\r\nникелированным покрытием.</span></span><span style=\"color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','products/1066/33.jpg',69000,1,'2026-09-03 20:58:05','2026-09-03 20:58:06',NULL,69),(1067,'Ошейник узкий (галаргамма)','osejnik-uzkij-galargamma',NULL,NULL,'3124-39','3124-39','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-