nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">VEGAN<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Совместима с презервативами из латекса, полиизопрена и\r\nполиуретана<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Безопасна для использования с секс-игрушками из любых\r\nматериалов<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Улучшает вашу интимную жизнь естественным способом<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Масло жожоба<br><o:p></o:p></span></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Масло жожоба интенсивно увлажняет, обеспечивает защиту\r\nнежных тканей от повреждений, создаёт максимально длительное шелковистое\r\nскольжение.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">&nbsp;<u>Гуаровая камедь<br><o:p></o:p></u></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Гуаровая камедь - натуральный загуститель, обладает\r\nувлажняющим и влагоудерживающим свойством. Получают камедь из семян растения\r\nгуар, известного также как гороховое дерево.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">&nbsp;Лимонная кислота<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Лимонная кислота</span></u><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\"> помогает поддерживать\r\nоптимальный уровень рН, является естественным консервантом.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">&nbsp;<u>Сок листьев алоэ<br><o:p></o:p></u></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Органический сок листьев алоэ прекрасно увлажняет,\r\nуспокаивает и заживляет. Его гладкая и шелковистая текстура идеально подходит\r\nдля длительного скольжения во время интимной близости.<o:p></o:p></span></h4><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>','products/2315/098.jpg',85000,0,'2026-09-03 21:11:59','2026-09-03 21:11:59',NULL,308),(2316,'Лубрикант на водной основе «Ёska» «Летняя ночь», 75 мл','lubrikant-na-vodnoj-osnove-eska-letnaa-noc-75-ml',NULL,NULL,'2735es','2735es','<h4 style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 15.75pt; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1\">Попробуй вкус летней ночи!<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Манящий и нежный, как теплая летняя ночь. Дыхание свежей прохлады с\r\nароматом луговых трав. Сладкая влажность летней зелени зовет тебя на встречу\r\nновым чувствам. Это натуральный лубрикант для любви от Ёska.<br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">100% безопасная, чистая и натуральная формула.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Органический экстракт василька и мелиссы успокаивает,\r\nснимает сухость и раздражение. Обладает смягчающим и противовоспалительными\r\nсвойствами.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-fareast-language:RU\">Сладковато-лимонный аромат мелиссы пробуждает чувства.<br><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-fareast-language:RU\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant