ht: 115%; color: black; font-family: Arial;\">\r\nВодонепроницаемость: IPX7 (полная защита от воды)<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; color: black; font-family: Arial;\">\r\nTalia — это ваш идеальный выбор для двойной стимуляции и новых ощущений!</span></h4>','products/2347/045.jpg',649000,1,'2026-09-03 21:12:22','2026-09-03 21:12:23',NULL,307),(2348,'Ванд «Love to Love» BRUSH CRUSH - MIDNIGHT INDIGO','vand-love-to-love-brush-crush-midnight-indigo',NULL,NULL,'6032633','6032633','<p style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">Ванд</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US\"> BRUSH CRUSH - MIDNIGHT INDIGO </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1\">Побалуйте</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">себя</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">продолжительными</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n11.0pt;font-family:&quo